    "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-54cb243f48cd77fcebe674a4",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在低阶模型中，有时需要保留原系统 G_H(s) 的主导极点。这可以通过将 G_L(s) 的分母指定为 G_H(s) 的主导极点，并允许对 G_L(s) 的分子进行近似来实现。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "It is sometimes desirable to retain the dominant poles of the original system, G_H(s), in the low-order model. This can be accomplished by specifying the denominator of G_L(s) to be the dominant poles of G_H(s) and allowing the numerator of G_L(s) to be subject to approximation.",
